 "nodes": {
  "970555384": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    95258894,
    -1642601325,
    -583767047
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Alright, it’s finally here! The Prisme! I wanted to open it with you. It feels... special, you know?",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "95258894": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 970555384,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Of course. Let’s see it together!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1642601325": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 970555384,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Ready for the big reveal?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-583767047": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 970555384,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Hope they didn’t shove you in the corner. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1194676624": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "...Wait. What? No, no, no. This can’t be real.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "onStart": [
    {
     "kind": "setActive",
     "type": "InstructionGameObjectSetActive",
     "title": "Set Active PrismeMagazine1 to True",
     "fields": {
      "m_Active": {
       "kind": "value",
       "value": true
      },
      "m_GameObject": {
       "kind": "object",
       "name": "PrismeMagazine1",
       "of": "GetGameObjectInstance",
       "path": "15_EventUI/PrismeMagazine1"
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "357002555": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Look at this! I’m... I’m barely even there! They made me some kind of background decoration!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1339236915": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    383195202,
    -300494146,
    2104561931
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And—ugh—her butt is covering half my face!",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1755288934": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "... \"From 40 onward\" ...  \"It's never too late to give your best\" ... Are you kidding me?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1867198079": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    1928073348,
    -1423791420,
    1082237148
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "The article... It’s not even about me. It’s basically asking, ‘Can women over 40 still keep up?’ ",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1928073348": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1867198079,
   "children": [
    1979844397
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You deserve so much more than this.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1423791420": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1867198079,
   "children": [
    -249471094
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Well, you’ve definitely proven them wrong. You’re thriving.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1082237148": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1867198079,
   "children": [
    1339134984
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "So much for tasteful journalism, huh?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-249471094": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1423791420,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I wish I could feel that way right now. But it’s hard when they’ve made me look like some kind of relic.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1339134984": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1082237148,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Seriously. I should’ve known better than to trust these people.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1979844397": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1928073348,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Exactly! I’ve worked so hard, and they reduce me to \"a woman over 40\"? It’s not fair.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "383195202": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1339236915,
   "children": [
    521181136
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I’m so sorry, {M}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-300494146": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1339236915,
   "children": [
    -674130046
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Wow. Did they even tell you Celeste would be the focus?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2104561931": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1339236915,
   "children": [
    1514165319
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Well... at least you’re technically on the cover. That’s something, right?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1514165319": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2104561931,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Don’t even try to spin this, okay? This is humiliating!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-674130046": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -300494146,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "No! They didn’t say a word about it. They made it sound like I was a big part of the article!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "521181136": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 383195202,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I can’t believe I let myself get so excited for this. I thought... I thought I mattered.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1518337476": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    1703963381,
    543119832
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "You know what? I’ve had it! I’m sick of being in the background while people like her get all the attention.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "onStart": [
    {
     "kind": "setActive",
     "type": "InstructionGameObjectSetActive",
     "title": "Set Active PrismeMagazine1 to False",
     "fields": {
      "m_Active": {
       "kind": "value",
       "value": false
      },
      "m_GameObject": {
       "kind": "object",
       "name": "PrismeMagazine1",
       "of": "GetGameObjectInstance",
       "path": "15_EventUI/PrismeMagazine1"
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "1703963381": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1518337476,
   "children": [
    633132449
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You mean Celeste?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "543119832": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1518337476,
   "children": [
    1245168839
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Exactly! You're so much better than her!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "633132449": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1703963381,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Of course, I mean Celeste! She just waltzes into every spotlight, and people fall at her feet like she’s the only one who matters. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1245168839": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 543119832,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Celeste just waltzes into every spotlight, and people fall at her feet like she’s the only one who matters. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1293717728": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Well, I’m done being shy about this. If she can do it, so can I.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1513505246": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1046776055,
    615921659,
    1817281386
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m ready to try livestreaming. I know I’ve always been too nervous before, but... If this is what it takes to keep up with her.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1046776055": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1513505246,
   "children": [
    -861435739
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I think that’s a great idea. You’ll show everyone the real you—and they’ll love it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "615921659": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1513505246,
   "children": [
    57357901
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Are you sure? Livestreaming can be tough.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1817281386": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1513505246,
   "children": [
    -121311820
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "If you’re doing this out of anger, it might backfire.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-121311820": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1817281386,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "I know it seems impulsive, but this feels right. I need to prove to myself—and everyone else—that I can do this.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "57357901": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 615921659,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I know it’ll be hard, but I’m ready for it. I can’t let my nerves control me anymore.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-861435739": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1046776055,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Thank you. I’ve been holding myself back for too long. It’s time I take control of my own story.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-374425729": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "I'll show that stupid bitch...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
